# Mobile meta (Projects + Insights)

## Featured leads（项目 / 见解主推，不受筛选器影响）

Meta sits **under the cover** (not on-image), three-up:

1. **Title** — left (**35%**)
2. **Gap** — **10%**
3. **Description / tagline** — center (**35%**)
4. **Type chip** — right (**20%** column, end-aligned)

**Top-align** title, description, and chip (`align-items: start`).

Applies to `.project-featured__meta` and `.insights-lead__meta`.

## Filter / Related cards

On viewports `≤800px` (and the same rhythm on tablet/laptop cards):

1. **Title:** up to **65%** of the card width.
2. **Type chip:** end-aligned on the title row; **top-aligned** with the title (`align-self: start`).
3. **Description / tagline:** **full width** under the title row.

Chip size (mobile): `font-size: 0.5625rem`, `padding: 0.2rem 0.45rem`.

Applies to:

- `.project-window__meta--stack`（项目卡片 / 项目详情 Related）
- `.insight-showcase__meta`（见解卡片 / 见解详情 Related）
- `.project-case-demo__hero-copy`（项目详情首屏 — follow lead three-up when desktop）

Do not bottom-align type chips on filter/related cards or featured leads.
